   "raw_text": "Moonsic\n\nAbout | Links | Contact\n\nKeep the music flowin' — Donate to moonsic.com\n\nFor More about O'Sensei's Process or other Aikido videos, please visit: Moonsensei.com\n\nLiko Martin — \"Liko Martin Right Now\" / \"Surfin' Bay Blues\"\nEugene Lesser — The man, the myth, the poet\nR. Moon — Moon Music\nThe New Improved Night Nurses\nThe New Improved Jook Savages",
